<title>USA: VocalTec names president.</title>
<headline>VocalTec names president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>VocalTec Communications Ltd said it had named Doron Zinger as its president, a newly created position.</p>
<p>Zinger joins from ECI Telecom Ltd, a provider of digital telecommunications and data transmission systems headquartered in Petah Tikva, Israel, where he was senior vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
